shortdesc Adjust margins of text block
relocated 1
longdesc The package provides the environment fullwidth, which sets the
longdesc left and right margins in a simple way. There is no constraint
longdesc about page breaks; if you are using the twoside mode, you can
longdesc set the inner and outer margins to avoid the effects of the
longdesc different margins.
